    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個動作，你可以對距你30尺內的一名可見生物揮舞這張卡片以吸取其生命力。目標必須進行一次DC 17的體質豁免，豁免失敗則受到4d8點暗蝕傷害。然後，你恢復等於目標受到的暗蝕傷害的生命值。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself and drain its life force. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=17]] saving throw or take [[/damage 4d8 type=necrotic]] damage. You then regain a number of hit points equal to the necrotic damage the target takes. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.\"</p></div>",
